text:
This looks like a stainless steel mixing bowl of raw sliced vegetables: red onion, red and green bell pepper, carrot shreds, and possibly cabbage. The bowl is probably about 25-30 cm across, though the photo is taken close up. The vegetables form a thin layer covering the bottom.

I estimate about 200 g of vegetables. At roughly 35 kcal per 100 g, that comes to about 70 kcal, and I see no visible oil.

